em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Rebar%20Detailers\">Request Rebar Detailers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Rebar Detailer</li><li>Steel Detailer</li><li>Structural CAD Draftsman</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Detail reinforcement in 3D from the structural design drawings</li><li>Produce placement drawings and bar bending schedules</li><li>Resolve congestion at joints, laps and openings</li><li>Detail to the codes specified by the engineer of record</li><li>Issue revisions with a matching revision log</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Revit Rebar</span><span>Tekla</span><span>AutoCAD</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class=\"plain\"><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\">Onsite BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\">Remote BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM Resource Outsourcing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\">Dedicated BIM Teams</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/rebar-detailing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Rebar Detailing</b><span>Reinforcement</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/shop-drawings/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Shop Drawings</b><span>Documentation</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Where this work <em>was delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/steel-structure-detailing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Steel Structure BIM &#038; Detailing: Warehouse &#038; Industrial</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/rebar-detailing-and-structural-quantity-takeoff/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Rebar Detailing &#038; Structural Quantity Takeoff</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300–400</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Hiring <em>Rebar Detailers.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>Which codes do your detailers work to?<i></i></summary><p>The codes specified by the structural engineer of record on the project; the published portfolio includes BS 8666:2020 and ASTM A615 work.</p></details><details><summary>Do you produce bar bending schedules?<i></i></summary><p>Yes. Bar bending schedules are issued for fabrication with a matching revision log.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other disciplines</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More <em>professionals.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/architectural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM Engineers</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/structural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM Engineers</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mep-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>MEP BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mechanical-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Mechanical BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/electrical-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Electrical BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/plumbing-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Plumbing BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/infrastructure-bim-e